From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?Lu=C3=ADs=20Duarte?= <lduarte@cloudflare.com>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 11:07:37 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] code_block: build the inline caches on first use

Each property-access site kept a 36-byte inline cache from compile
time on, a fifth of a compiled bundle's retained code, while most of a
bundle's functions never run. Keep only the property names and build
the caches the first time the code block touches one.
---
